      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lisbon%2C_Connecticut"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Lisbon is home to the Taft Tunnel, the oldest railroad tunnel in America, built in 1837.",
