      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lisbon%2C_Connecticut"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Anshei Israel Synagogue, constructed in 1936, is a rare rural synagogue listed on the National Register of Historic Places.",
